WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:23.840
Choose the sales analyst to explore the fictional company's figures.

2
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:57.080
Ask for regional revenue as a chart.

3
00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:02.400
The chart shows each region and repeats its total in text.

4
00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:26.440
Follow up with a question about East's gross margin.

5
00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:33.000
East's margin appears with revenue and the monthly working.

6
00:01:33.040 --> 00:02:05.240
Ask where to find the next quarter's forecast.

7
00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:11.500
The analyst points the forecast question to the finance planning team.

8
00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:45.140
Open the workflow behind the sales answer.

9
00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:53.580
The workflow reads the records, checks the rows and calculates totals.

10
00:02:55.500 --> 00:03:10.260
The records board holds the fictional company's quarterly sales figures.

11
00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:32.860
An automated test changes one revenue cell to demonstrate a data warning.

12
00:03:33.660 --> 00:04:00.340
Ask the same margin question in a fresh chat.

13
00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:30.620
The analyst reads the updated figures before answering.

14
00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:39.780
The answer identifies the row to correct and marks its total incomplete.

15
00:04:40.700 --> 00:05:06.000
Open the analyst settings to review its link to the sales workflow.
